    "title": "Tavlo Sandbox API",
    "version": "0.2.0",
    "description": "Persistent QR Pay sandbox. Mock POS and payment providers by default. Paystack is test-only. Merchant endpoints require operator scope; mock controls are disabled for Paystack."
